            "review_title": "Review at Ngon Vegan Bistro & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Susan K\n30 contributions\n0\nNgon - best vegan restaurant Can Tho\nNov 2025 • Friends\nI came across the restaurant on the river bank of the Mekong. I’ve eaten there for the last 3 days and every meal and juice was absolutely delicious. My friend isn’t vegetarian but she has fallen in love with their food as well.\nInsider tip:\nThere is an upstairs level with great view to the Mekong and night lights. They also do takeaways.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 24, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
