            "review_title": "Review at Ngon Vegan Bistro & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Logan G\n1 contribution\n0\nHonestly Amazing- went back 3 times\nOct 2025 • Friends\nAs a non vegan who loves Pho, this was the best I’ve had in Vietnam yet. The staff and food were superb and really well priced - for France, England and Australia. \nWe ordered pretty much everything on the menu and there is no complaints. \nWe were in Can Tho for 1 day and had breakfast, lunch and 2 dinners here. \n\nThe staff were helpful and very attentive without pressuring us into ordering, with the help of google translate the answer any questions we had. The vibe just matched the fun staff with a relaxed and lowkey environment.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 13, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
