            "review_title": "Review at Ngon Vegan Bistro & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Extraordinary47285\n1 contribution\n0\nFantastic!\nSep 2025 • Solo\nWhy isn’t this place listed in the list of best places to eat in Can Tho?? Bummed that i only found this place on the last of my 2 days here because I try more. Food is great, honestly best vegan/veggie food i’ve had in Vietnam - and it’s pretty easy to get board of those offerings. Genuinely delish! I don’t usually leave reviews but this was TTHAT good. Also bought one of their ‘ready to eat’ products to add to my own meals - they have interesting things like the oddly named ‘vegan crab fat’ but it was in my soup and it was yum!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 1, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
