            "review_title": "Review at Ngon Vegan Bistro & Cafe",
            "review_text": "Cong L\n1 contribution\n0\nLoved Every Bite at Ngon Vegan 💚\nJun 2025 • Friends\nHad lunch here with friends and it was everything we needed, soft music, beautiful natural light, calming earthy tones, and that subtle scent of lemongrass and herbs floating in the air. Instant peace. \nAll plant-based, so refreshing. We lingered for hours, just enjoying the moment. It’s rare to find a place that feeds both your body and your soul. Ngon Vegan truly does. Can’t wait to be back.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nDon’t skip the Juicivita drinks – they’re fresh, creative, and perfect in Mekong’s heat. The rooftop is lovely in the evening\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 11, 2025",
